  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed project &#x2018;Strengthening institutional capacity to implement and manage evidence-based maternal, infant, young child and adolescent nutrition programme&#x2019; would provide support for the: 1) Pilot implementation of social behaviour change communication (SBCC) strategy on maternal, infant and young child nutrition (MIYCN) 2) Development of a nutrition information system (NIS) strategy3) Development of a nutrition sentinel surveillance system guideline and4) A formative research on adolescent nutrition practices and support structures</narrative>
